3. Universal DNS Template
For Vercel:
●
●
●
Apex/root domain uses an A record.
Subdomains use CNAME records.
Vercel’s own docs confirm apex domains use A records and subdomains use CNAME
records.
Recommended:
A
Name: @
Value: 76.76.21.21
CNAME
Name: www
Value: cname.vercel-dns.com
CNAME
Name: api
Value: your-api-host.example.com
CNAME
Name: dashboard
Value: your-dashboard-host.example.com
CNAME
Name: status
Value: your-status-host.example.com
TXT
Name:
_gnaia-verify
Value: shanta-id-1.0
The TXT record becomes your permanent internal verification stamp.
4. Cloudflare / Universal Routing Option
For stronger portability:
Use Cloudflare as the DNS and security layer.
Benefits:
●
●
●
●
●
Keeps DNS stable
Lets backend targets change
Supports proxy routing
